{"seq":4,"slug":"eligible-goods-classification-criteria","title":"适用货物分类与准入判定标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ata-carnet-temporary-admission/temporary-admission-scope/eligible-goods-classification-criteria","wordCount":2982,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"适用货物分类与准入判定标准\">适用货物分类与准入判定标准</h1><p>跨境工程里最容易返工的一步，是把合适的货物放进合适的监管篮子。同一台演示样机，作为「展览品」出境可以免担保穿行多国，作为「待售货物」出境必须照章征税，而作为「待维修整机」出境连暂时进出境的门槛都够不到——三种处置对应同一件实物，差别只在分类判定。本文把 ATA 单证册这条通道的<strong>适用货物分类体系</strong>与<strong>准入判定规则</strong>拆成可执行步骤：先给分类骨架，再给硬性排除项，最后落到报关系统能跑起来的判定表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分类骨架由公约附约与国内列举两套坐标构成\">核心概念：分类骨架由公约附约与国内列举两套坐标构成</h2><p>判定一件货能否走 ATA 单证册，先要理解世界上存在两套并行的分类坐标。第一套是国际法坐标——《伊斯坦布尔公约》用<strong>附约（Annex）<strong>按&quot;进口目的&quot;把暂准进口的货物切成若干族，ATA 单证册能够直接承载的是其中几个特定附约（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ATA_Carnet\">Wikipedia: ATA Carnet</a>；<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/facilitation/instrument-and-tools/conventions/pf_ata_system_conven.aspx\">WCO: ATA System</a>）。第二套是国内法坐标——中国海关总署令第 233 号《中华人民共和国海关暂时进出境货物管理办法》用</strong>六类活动</strong>列举适用范围，而单证册在中国落地的&quot;货物篮&quot;再收窄为展览品、专业设备、商业样品三类。</p>\n<p>两套坐标不是互相翻译，而是<strong>层层收敛</strong>：公约束定&quot;制度允许什么&quot;，国内法锁定&quot;本关境承认什么&quot;，ATA 单证册再限定&quot;这本证承载什么&quot;。因此分类判定必须走<strong>三阶漏斗</strong>，任一阶不通过就不能出单证册，只能退到普通暂时进出境或一般贸易。公约附约与货物族的对应关系如下（《伊斯坦布尔公约》1993 年生效；ATA 公约 1961 年布鲁塞尔签署、1963 年生效）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>附约</th>\n<th>货物族</th>\n<th>典型货物</th>\n<th>ATA 单证册可承载</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>暂准进口单证（ATA / CPD 本身）</td>\n<td>单证册、报关担保文件</td>\n<td>制度载体，非货物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.1</td>\n<td>展览、交易会、会议用货物</td>\n<td>展品、展台设备、宣传物料</td>\n<td>是（核心）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.2</td>\n<td>专业设备</td>\n<td>摄影、录音、测量、演出器材</td>\n<td>是（核心）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.3</td>\n<td>集装箱、托盘、包装、商业样品</td>\n<td>货样、包装容器</td>\n<td>部分（商业样品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.4</td>\n<td>与制造作业相关的货物</td>\n<td>生产用模具、测试治具</td>\n<td>一般否（改变状态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.5</td>\n<td>教育、科学、文化用货物</td>\n<td>教具、科研仪器</td>\n<td>视国别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.6</td>\n<td>旅客个人物品与体育用品</td>\n<td>运动器材、乐器</td>\n<td>视国别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.7</td>\n<td>旅游宣传物料</td>\n<td>宣传册、展板</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B.9</td>\n<td>人道主义用途货物</td>\n<td>救灾器材</td>\n<td>视国别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>运输工具</td>\n<td>车辆、飞行器</td>\n<td>有限（营运用途排除）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>动物</td>\n<td>展演动物、赛马</td>\n<td>否（活体另有规则）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>部分免税货物</td>\n<td>特定处置品</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论落到一句话：<strong>ATA 单证册的&quot;货物篮&quot;≈ 附约 B.1 + B.2 + B.3 的商业样品部分</strong>，其余附约或需国内法单独授权，或天然与&quot;原状复运&quot;冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类核心货物族的判定特征\">三类核心货物族的判定特征</h2><p>单证册真正承载的三类货物，各自的判定锚点不同，混用会直接触发核销争议。</p>\n<p><strong>展览品（附约 B.1）。</strong> 判定锚点是&quot;<strong>为展示或使用而临时进口</strong>&quot;，须能证明其在展会、交易会、会议现场的实际用途。工程判据：货物是否列入主办方展品清单、是否有展位号可挂靠。展台结构件、宣传物料、演示样机均属此族。边界陷阱是<strong>展会结束后留在境内处置的物料</strong>——一旦放弃复运就脱离 B.1 的用途限定。</p>\n<p><strong>专业设备（附约 B.2）。</strong> 判定锚点是&quot;<strong>为完成特定专业作业而临时进口</strong>&quot;，典型为摄影摄像、录音、舞台灯光、测量仪器、工程工具；中国 233 号令对应&quot;新闻报道或摄制电影、电视节目&quot;与&quot;科研、教学、医疗&quot;两类。边界陷阱是<strong>以营运方式使用的设备</strong>：载客经营的车辆、对外计费出租的器材，会被认为脱离&quot;自用作业&quot;而落入营运排除。</p>\n<p><strong>商业样品（附约 B.3 的商业样品部分）。</strong> 判定锚点是&quot;<strong>仅为展示或试用、不进入商业流通</strong>&quot;。这一族最接近&quot;货样广告品&quot;，区别在<strong>是否复运</strong>：商业样品必复运，货样广告品通常不复运。</p>\n<p>三类货物的判定特征可压缩为一张对照表，供规则引擎取字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>货物族</th>\n<th>判定锚点</th>\n<th>关键凭证</th>\n<th>常见误判</th>\n<th>复运期限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>展览品</td>\n<td>展会/会议现场展示用途</td>\n<td>展品清单、展位号、邀请函</td>\n<td>展会物料留存境内处置</td>\n<td>展会结束后按 6 个月口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专业设备</td>\n<td>完成特定专业作业</td>\n<td>设备清单、作业合同/拍摄计划</td>\n<td>出租计费的营运使用</td>\n<td>作业结束后按 6 个月口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业样品</td>\n<td>仅展示试用、不流通</td>\n<td>样品清单、无成交证明</td>\n<td>混入已成交货物</td>\n<td>按 6 个月口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"准入判定标准-硬性排除项与-原状-检验\">准入判定标准：硬性排除项与&quot;原状&quot;检验</h2><p>分类合格只是必要条件，准入判定还要过一道<strong>硬性排除</strong>。这些排除项不是解释空间，而是由&quot;原状复运&quot;内核直接推出：凡复运时无法保持原状的货物，都不能走暂时进出境，ATA 单证册亦然。排除项按成因分四组：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>消耗型货物</strong>——复运对象在使用后不存在（一次性耗材、燃料、食品、药品、分发光盘）。判据：若复运时数量必然减少，即排除。</li>\n<li><strong>加工/维修型货物</strong>——进口目的本身要改变货物状态（待修整机、待加工原料、待分装散货）。判据：若复运时品名、规格必然变化，即排除。边界：<strong>更换易损件、正常使用磨损被容忍</strong>，但把整机拆解为部件单独处置不构成原状复运。</li>\n<li><strong>销售型货物</strong>——已确定销售用途或已成交的货物。判据：若存在采购订单、合同或已收款事实，即排除。</li>\n<li><strong>营运交通型货物</strong>——以营利性运输方式使用的运输工具。判据：若用途是&quot;载客/载货经营&quot;，即排除。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&quot;原状&quot;检验可写成可计算的一致性判据。设出境申报清单为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_0=\\{(n_i,q_i,s_i)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>（品名、数量、规格），复运清单为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_1=\\{(n_j,q_j,s_j)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>，则核销一致性要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall i:\\ q_i^{G_1} \\ge q_i^{G_0} \\cdot (1-\\delta),\\quad n_i^{G_1}=n_i^{G_0},\\quad s_i^{G_1}=s_i^{G_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2001em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2001em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span sty