\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2001em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2001em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1449em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为容许的正常损耗率（按货物类别与关区口径取值，消耗型货物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 即直接排除）。系统应在出证阶段就预计算这对集合的匹配度，而非等核销时才发现无法闭合。此外还有一组<strong>国别级排除</strong>：货物即使分类与复运合格，也可能因目的国不接受该附约、或属禁限管制（爆炸物、军品、部分动植物制品）而被拒，必须在<strong>签发前</strong>按目的国清单核对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与货样广告品的分类边界\">与货样广告品的分类边界</h2><p>&quot;商业样品&quot;与&quot;货样广告品&quot;是题目里最需要钉死的一对概念，因为在报关系统里它们常共用同一批实物却走完全不同的制度。<strong>货样广告品</strong>的核心特征是&quot;用于展示、宣传且<strong>通常不复运</strong>&quot;——要么按 3010（有进出口经营权的企业）或 3039（无经营权单位）等监管方式征税通关，要么在法定限额内免税，属<strong>贸易属性的通关方式</strong>，永不产生复运义务。<strong>暂时进出境的商业样品</strong>的核心特征是&quot;<strong>必然复运</strong>&quot;，属资格制度。二者互斥，判定只需一问：<strong>这批样品用完要不要运回去？</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S[一批实物样品] --&gt; Q1{使用后是否复运?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否 留在境外/境内| T[货样广告品&lt;br/&gt;3010/3039 征税或限额免税]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是 原状运回| Q2{用途属六类列举?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| X[不符合暂时进出境&lt;br/&gt;退回一般贸易]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| Q3{属展品/专业设备/商业样品?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| C[ATA 单证册&lt;br/&gt;统一担保]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| P[普通暂时进出境申报]&#10;    T --&gt; M[系统标签: 贸易属性 无复运义务]&#10;    C --&gt; N[系统标签: 资格制度 绑定复运期限]&#10;    P --&gt; N\">graph TD\n    S[一批实物样品] --&gt; Q1{使用后是否复运?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|否 留在境外/境内| T[货样广告品&lt;br/&gt;3010/3039 征税或限额免税]\n    Q1 --&gt;|是 原状运回| Q2{用途属六类列举?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| X[不符合暂时进出境&lt;br/&gt;退回一般贸易]\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| Q3{属展品/专业设备/商业样品?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| C[ATA 单证册&lt;br/&gt;统一担保]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| P[普通暂时进出境申报]\n    T --&gt; M[系统标签: 贸易属性 无复运义务]\n    C --&gt; N[系统标签: 资格制度 绑定复运期限]\n    P --&gt; N</pre><p>工程纪律：同一 SKU 只能挂<strong>一个</strong>互斥标签——标记为暂时进出境即绑定复运期限与核销责任，标记为货样/广告品即按贸易属性处理、永不产生复运义务。把两者混在同一标签下，核销台账必然无法闭合，这是实务中最高频的争议来源之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定表与落地清单\">判定表与落地清单</h2><p>把上述规则压成可执行的判定表，报关系统即可在出证/下单阶段前置完成分类，避免货物抵港后被迫改单。判定表按优先级从上到下匹配，命中即停：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>命中禁限管制或目的国不接受该附约</td>\n<td>拒签</td>\n<td>改专门制度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>复运时数量/品名/规格必然变化</td>\n<td>不适用暂时进出境</td>\n<td>一般贸易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>存在成交/订单/采购事实</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>一般贸易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>用途为营利性运输经营</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>一般贸易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>使用后不复运</td>\n<td>货样广告品</td>\n<td>3010/3039</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>复运且属展品/专业设备/商业样品</td>\n<td>ATA 单证册</td>\n<td>统一担保出证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>复运且属其余法定用途</td>\n<td>普通暂时进出境</td>\n<td>逐票担保申报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地清单按序执行，任一步失败即回退：<strong>归类前置</strong>——备货阶段完成三阶漏斗判定；<strong>凭证挂靠</strong>——展览品挂展位号、专业设备挂作业合同、商业样品挂无成交证明；<strong>清单建模</strong>——为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 建结构化清单供复运比对；<strong>目的国核对</strong>——出证前确认目的国接受该附约、无国别级禁限；<strong>标签互斥</strong>——确认该 SKU 未被同时标记为货样/广告品；<strong>到期倒计时</strong>——出证即建复运倒计时并预留延期窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ATA 单证册的适用货物由<strong>三阶漏斗</strong>决定：公约附约允许 → 国内法六类用途 → 属展品/专业设备/商业样品。</li>\n<li>单证册的实际&quot;货物篮&quot;≈《伊斯坦布尔公约》附约 <strong>B.1（展品）+ B.2（专业设备）+ B.3 的商业样品部分</strong>；附约 C（营运运输工具）、D（动物）、E（部分免税）不在其内。</li>\n<li>三类核心货物族各有判定锚点：展品的展位、专业设备的作业、商业样品的&quot;不流通&quot;。</li>\n<li>四组<strong>硬性排除</strong>由&quot;原状复运&quot;推出：消耗型、加工/维修型、销售型、营运交通型；&quot;原状&quot;可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的一致性判据，应出证即预计算。</li>\n<li>商业样品与货样广告品互斥，判定只需一问&quot;用完是否复运&quot;；同一 SKU 只能挂一个标签。</li>\n<li>分类判定必须<strong>前置到备货阶段</strong>，并叠加目的国核对，避免到港卡货。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分类判定完成后，单证册的结构、出证链条与担保安排见<a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>指向的后续文档 <a href=\"../carnet-application-guarantee/ata-carnet-structure-issuing-chain\">ATA 单证册结构与出证链条</a>；期限与复运核销的落地见 <a href=\"../temporary-period-reexport/\">暂时进出境期限与复运核销</a>；本文的制度底座（法律依据与适用范围）见 <a href=\"temporary-admission-legal-basis-scope\">暂时进出境制度的法律依据与适用范围</a>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：本文分类依据为公开的 WCO《ATA 公约》（1961）、《伊斯坦布尔公约》（1990）附约文本、中国海关总署令第 233 号《海关暂时进出境货物管理办法》（2018-02-01 施行），以及 ATA/WCO 关于 eATA 数字化的公开说明（欧盟、挪威、瑞士、列支敦士登、英国于 2026-06-01 起承认电子单证册，全球全面数字化预期 2028-01-01 完成）。截至 2026-10 未检索到上述规则的废止或替代性修订，实际报关请以现行有效文本及属地海关口径为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"适用货物分类与准入判定标准","id":"适用货物分类与准入判定标准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分类骨架由公约附约与国内列举两套坐标构成","id":"核心概念-分类骨架由公约附约与国内列举两套坐标构成"},{"level":2,"text":"三类核心货物族的判定特征","id":"三类核心货物族的判定特征"},{"level":2,"text":"准入判定标准：硬性排除项与\"原状\"检验","id":"准入判定标准-硬性排除项与-原状-检验"},{"level":2,"text":"与货样广告品的分类边界","id":"与货样广告品的分类边界"},{"level":2,"text":"判定表与落地清单","id":"判定表与落地清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"暂时进出境与保税、转关模式的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ata-carnet-temporary-admission/temporary-admission-scope/temporary-admission-bonded-transit-boundary"},"next":{"title":"ATA 单证册的结构与签发担保链条","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ata-carnet-temporary-admission/carnet-application-guarantee/ata-carnet-structure-issuing-chain"}}